# Loaded ONLY by `npm run build:chrome` (vite --mode chrome), overriding .env.
# Identical content to .env.firefox — see that file's comment for the full
# reasoning (a developer .env pointing at localhost must never leak into a
# store-bound "distribution" build). Kept as a separate file rather than
# shared with Firefox's, so each store target's env override is self-evident
# from its filename rather than one file secretly serving two build modes.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://retainhq.onrender.com
